title: Polish Red Autumn
new-page: true
go-to: poland_event_queue if started = 1 and poland_event_phase = 1; poland_hub if started = 1 and poland_event_phase != 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true

= Polish Red Autumn

**Poland, October 2019.** After four years outside parliament, the Left has
returned as an uneasy alliance of SLD machinery, Wiosna progressives, Razem
organisers and trade-union social democrats.

Hold that alliance together through the presidential election, COVID-19,
constitutional conflict, the border crisis, war and the July 2023
election-readiness reckoning—then survive the 2023 transfer of power and the
coalition crises through 2026.

- @campaign_game: Begin the October 2019 campaign
- @formation_game: Play the 2023 transfer of power
- @modinfo: About Polish Red Autumn
- @poland_credits: Credits and provenance

@start_menu_2
go-to: start_menu

@campaign_game
on-arrival: formation_requested = 0
go-to: new_game

@formation_game
on-arrival: formation_requested = 1
go-to: new_game

